 ## Background
-The Neural Pressure Projection Solver, also referred to as the Neural Euler Simulator, was proposed in the paper "Inferring Fluid Dynamics via Inverse Rendering" [S1, unofficial]. It integrates fluid simulation with inverse rendering, allowing for the inference of fluid dynamics from visual data. The method replaces the traditional pressure projection step with a learned neural network, facilitating end-to-end training for inverse problems [S1, unofficial].
